HEXhand
=======

HEXhand is a rebranded distribution of CatDesk.

    CatDesk — https://github.com/Xeift/CatDesk
    Copyright (c) 2026 xeift.eth
    Licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE)

Changes made for HEXhand: product naming, artwork, default configuration paths,
and an optional remote-connector mode that lets the MCP server run on one machine
while the working folder lives on another.

CatDesk is licensed under MIT; this distribution keeps the same licence and the
original copyright notice. HEXhand is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
CatDesk authors.
